        "id": 1074825
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T03:50:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose this mitigates the lack of raw_spin_lock_irqsave() in the pKVM namespace? Could we instead provide a replacement or stub for it? Sprinkling #ifndefs everywhere at the very least doesn\u0027t look good, and in practice this is likely to make the life of anyone modifying this code very hard.",
      "revId": "accc167fec7f3476dcbc6233fedb39dce8aeb71c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
