        "id": 1074825
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T03:50:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it make sense to separate code that restores pstore from last boot, from code that is used for working with the current pstore into separate files? We wouldn\u0027t have to sprinkle all those ifndefs then.",
      "revId": "accc167fec7f3476dcbc6233fedb39dce8aeb71c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
